    {"[color=#383838]█[/color][color=#ffffff]░░[/color][color=#8c0000]█ [color=#383838]█▄[/color] █ [/color][head=3]United Nations Marine Corps[/head]"}
    {"[color=#8c0000]▀▄▄[color=#383838]▀[/color] █[/color] [color=#383838]▀█[/color] [color=#AAAAAA]Marine High Command | [italic]2nd Battalion, 3rd Regiment[/italic][/color]   [color=#dfc189]✯  ✯[/color]"}

    {"[color=#383838]▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄[/color]"}
    {"[color=#8c0000]▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀[/color]"}

    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]SECTOR ENFORCEMENT CENTER - FORT THUNDER, TRAPPIST-5[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Engagement Protocol - Solaris Ridge AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-SE"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Solaris Ridge has gone dark under suspicious conditions."}

    {"Colonial records cite environmental failure, sabotage, and contamination."}

    {"All signs point to a serious biological threat and weak security oversight."}

    {"You are ordered to seize control of the area and reestablish dominance with decisive force."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Deploy a fortified base in the colony's administrative and secure any and all personnel files."}
    {"[bullet]Sweep colonial infrastructure and disused mineral transport network for signs of hostile infection."}
    {"[bullet]Capture or destroy all unauthorized Weston-Yamada materials and personnel as per Directive 61-E."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Enforce martial order across the Ridge and detain suspicious survivors in the field."}
    {"[bullet]Scuttle remaining research modules to prevent foreign exploitation."}
    {"[bullet]Reinforce the colony's perimeter and eliminate all unregistered lifeforms."}

    {"You are authorized to demolish critical infrastructure if it aids in strategic containment."}
    {"Let this serve as a warning to all: [underline]the Corps does not tolerate failure.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Margaret A.W. Shanks[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]United Nations Marine Corps | Colonial Protection Organization - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]No mercy. No doubt.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
