    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]PROVOST MARSHAL'S FIELD OFFICE - NEW MASON COLONY, 61 CYGNI SYSTEM[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Deployment Priorities - Solaris Ridge AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-HM"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Solaris Ridge is more than a derelict outpost, it's home to forgotten workers, families, and scientific pioneers."}

    {"Satellite interference suggests they've gone silent amid worsening environmental strain."}

    {"Your task is to protect what remains and who remains."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a relatively unobtrusive Forward Operating Base to avoid unnecessary disruption."}
    {"[bullet]Locate and assist any remaining research personnel, particularly those affiliated with atmospheric control and botany."}
    {"[bullet]Secure research findings relevant to the Ridge's lichen-based terraforming experiments."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Maintain structural integrity of airlocks and shelter points to facilitate civilian use."}
    {"[bullet]Avoid unnecessary force during crowd encounters or tunnel sweeps. Exercise judgment before lethal engagement."}
    {"[bullet]Use auxiliary medevac protocols for trauma cases discovered during recon missions."}

    {"Hearts and minds may not win every war, but they win the right ones."}
    {"[underline]Let your conduct reflect the humanity we fight to preserve.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Adrian Blackburn[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]UNMC Provost Marshal | Hearts & Minds Movement - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]In service to justice and peace.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
